We thank the reviewers for their time, effort, and recognition of our paper. In response to their comments and our own further scrutiny, we have optimized and updated the following content in the new version:  
1. Correct typos, refine phrasing in the main text, and update key citations;  
2. Introduce fundamental concepts regarding generalization theory (see Appendix A);  
3. Validate performance sensitivity to varying pruning rates on the HellaSwag and BoolQ datasets (see Figure 7 in Appendix F);  
4. Include an efficiency analysis of the baselines (see Table 10 in Appendix F);  
5. Provide further analysis and experiments concerning the slow manifold (see Figure 10 in Appendix H);  
6. Conduct additional analysis and experiments on computational overhead (see Appendix I).  
We have highlighted the key additions and revisions in blue. We are happy to address any further comments or questions during the remaining days of the discussion period.
